        "status": "published",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"Ood5dTvPNoqnHMxOOrHlbFmOgxf\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KyxTd9sGZo1AcwxkswNlVZXFgmd\"><em><strong>The table below gives information on the salaries of secondary teachers in five countries in 2009. Summarize the information by selecting and reporting the main points and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></em></div>\n</div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">IELTS Writing Task 1 - Secondary Teacher Salaries in Five Countries 2009</span></em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--StartFragment --></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"cf0\">Đ</span><span class=\"cf1\">ề b</span><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave;i <!--StartFragment --></span><span class=\"cf0\">Secondary Teacher Salaries in Five Countries 2009 </span><span class=\"cf2\"><!--EndFragment -->y&ecirc;u c</span><span class=\"cf1\">ầu m</span><span class=\"cf2\">&ocirc; t</span><span class=\"cf1\">ả về: mức l</span><span class=\"cf0\">ương c</span><span class=\"cf1\">ủa gi</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n trung h</span><span class=\"cf1\">ọc tại n</span><span class=\"cf0\">ăm qu</span><span class=\"cf1\">ốc gia trong n</span><span class=\"cf0\">ăm 2009.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span class=\"cf0\">(*) B</span><span class=\"cf1\">ạn n</span><span class=\"cf2\">&ecirc;n h</span><span class=\"cf1\">ọc </span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\"><a style=\"color: rgb(53, 152, 219); text-decoration: underline;\" href=\"https://rebrand.ly/so-lieu-tuyet-doi\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"cf1\">c</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;ch&nbsp;t</span><span class=\"cf1\">ả số liệu \"tuyệt đối\"</span><span class=\"cf1\"> v&agrave; paraphrase cấu tr</span><span class=\"cf2\">&uacute;c c&acirc;u</span></a></span></span><span class=\"cf2\"> tr</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf1\">ớc khi viết b</span><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave;i </span><span class=\"cf4\">&rarr; </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf2\">&acirc;y l&agrave; k</span><span class=\"cf1\">ỹ n</span><span class=\"cf0\">ăng vi</span><span class=\"cf1\">ết v</span><span class=\"cf2\">&ocirc; c&ugrave;ng quan tr</span><span class=\"cf1\">ọng </span><span class=\"cf0\">đ</span><span class=\"cf1\">ể d</span><span class=\"cf2\">&ugrave;ng trong c</span><span class=\"cf1\">ả b</span><span class=\"cf2\">&agrave;i vi</span><span class=\"cf1\">ết.</span></span></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--EndFragment --></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong><!--StartFragment --></strong></span>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase </span><span class=\"cf1\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ề với c</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;c d</span><span class=\"cf0\">ữ kiện ch</span><span class=\"cf2\">&iacute;nh l&agrave;: m</span><span class=\"cf0\">ức l</span><span class=\"cf1\">ương - gi</span><span class=\"cf2\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n trung h</span><span class=\"cf0\">ọc - n</span><span class=\"cf1\">ăm qu</span><span class=\"cf0\">ốc gia - n</span><span class=\"cf1\">ăm 2009.<br><br></span></p>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong><!--EndFragment --></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong><!--StartFragment --></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Theo Logical Framework</span><span class=\"cf1\"><sup>&copy;</sup>, </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf1\">&acirc;y l&agrave; d</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạng biểu </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ồ kh</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute; l&agrave; </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ặc biệt, v</span><span class=\"cf1\">&igrave; ch&uacute;ng ta c&oacute; t</span><span class=\"cf0\">ận 2 luồng th</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh trong m</span><span class=\"cf0\">ột biểu </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ồ. N</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ecirc;n trong ph</span><span class=\"cf0\">ần Overview m</span><span class=\"cf1\">&igrave;nh s</span><span class=\"cf0\">ẽ </span><span class=\"cf3\">đưa ra 2 th</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ocirc;ng tin ch&iacute;nh:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf1\">Gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở tất cả c</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;c qu</span><span class=\"cf0\">ốc gia </span><span class=\"cf3\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ề cập </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ều nhận </span><span class=\"cf3\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc mức l</span><span class=\"cf3\">ương cao hơn sau 15 năm, v</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave; nh</span><span class=\"cf0\">ững ng</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ời ở Luxembourg l</span><span class=\"cf1\">&uacute;c n&agrave;o c</span><span class=\"cf2\">ũng ki</span><span class=\"cf0\">ếm </span><span class=\"cf3\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc nhiều tiền nhất.</span></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Gi</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Denmark </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạt </span><span class=\"cf3\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc mức l</span><span class=\"cf3\">ương cao nh</span><span class=\"cf0\">ất nhanh nhất, trong khi </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ồng nghiệp của họ ở Korea mất thời gian l</span><span class=\"cf1\">&acirc;u nh</span><span class=\"cf0\">ất </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ể l</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave;m </span><span class=\"cf2\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc </span><span class=\"cf3\">đi</span><span class=\"cf0\">ều n</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave;y.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong><!--EndFragment --></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c hạng mục c&oacute; sự tương đồng, cụ thể như sau:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L7xXdRWJWocRvmxMQbil8bJOgRb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> M&ocirc; tả dữ liệu của Australia v&agrave; Denmark</strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong><!--StartFragment --></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Theo Logical Framework</span><span class=\"cf1\"><sup>&copy;</sup>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh s</span><span class=\"cf0\">ẽ </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ịnh h</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớng c</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;c b</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạn viết từng b</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc ở Body 1 nh</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư sau:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><strong><span class=\"cf2\">Bư</span></strong><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>ớc 1:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;nh m</span><span class=\"cf0\">ức l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương kh</span><span class=\"cf0\">ởi </span><span class=\"cf2\">đi</span><span class=\"cf0\">ểm <em>(gi</em></span><em><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Denmark kiếm </span><span class=\"cf2\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc $47,000, cao h</span><span class=\"cf2\">ơn gi</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Australia, $34,000)</span></em></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><strong><span class=\"cf0\">B</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư</span></strong><span class=\"cf0\"><strong>ớc 2:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;nh th</span><span class=\"cf0\">ời gian </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ể gi</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n hai n</span><span class=\"cf3\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạt mức l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương t</span><span class=\"cf0\">ối </span><span class=\"cf2\">đa <em>(c</em></span><em><span class=\"cf0\">ả hai </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ều cần khoảng 1 thập kỷ, với gi</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Denmark </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạt </span><span class=\"cf2\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc mức l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương $54,000 v</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave; gi&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Australia cần $48,000)</span></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong><!--EndFragment --></strong></span></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\">BODY 2<strong>: M&ocirc; tả dữ liệu của Luxumbourg, Korea v&agrave; Japan</strong></span></h4>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong><!--StartFragment --></strong></span></p>\n<p class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">Theo Logical Framework</span><span class=\"cf1\"><sup>&copy;</sup>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh s</span><span class=\"cf0\">ẽ </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ịnh h</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớng c</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;c b</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạn viết từng b</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớc ở Body 2 nh</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư sau:</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf2\"><strong>Bước 1:</strong> So s</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;nh m</span><span class=\"cf0\">ức l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương kh</span><span class=\"cf0\">ởi </span><span class=\"cf2\">đi</span><span class=\"cf0\">ểm <em>(gi</em></span><em><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Luxembourg cao nhất với $80,000, gi</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Korea v</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave; Japan th&igrave; ki</span><span class=\"cf0\">ếm </span><span class=\"cf2\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc </span><span class=\"cf1\">&iacute;t h</span><span class=\"cf3\">ơn, $30,000)</span></em></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf3\"><strong>Bước 2:</strong> M</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ocirc; t</span><span class=\"cf0\">ả xu h</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớng l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương c</span><span class=\"cf0\">ủa gi</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Luxembourg <em>(sau 15 n</em></span><em><span class=\"cf2\">ăm tăng l</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ecirc;n $112,000 v&agrave; c</span><span class=\"cf0\">ần th</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ecirc;m 15 n</span><span class=\"cf3\">ăm n</span><span class=\"cf0\">ữa th</span><span class=\"cf1\">&igrave; m</span><span class=\"cf0\">ới </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạt </span><span class=\"cf2\">đư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ợc mức l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương t</span><span class=\"cf0\">ối </span><span class=\"cf2\">đa l</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave; $139,000)</span></em></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf1\"><strong>Bước 3:</strong> M&ocirc; t</span><span class=\"cf0\">ả xu h</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư</span><span class=\"cf0\">ớng l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương c</span><span class=\"cf0\">ủa gi</span><span class=\"cf1\">&aacute;o vi&ecirc;n </span><span class=\"cf0\">ở Korea v</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave; Japan <em>(t</em></span><em><span class=\"cf3\">ăng g</span><span class=\"cf0\">ần nh</span><span class=\"cf2\">ư g</span><span class=\"cf0\">ấp </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf1\">&ocirc;i </span><span class=\"cf3\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ến $50,000 sau 15 n</span><span class=\"cf2\">ăm v</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave; c</span><span class=\"cf0\">ần khoảng 35 n</span><span class=\"cf2\">ăm đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ể </span><span class=\"cf2\">đ</span><span class=\"cf0\">ạt mức l</span><span class=\"cf2\">ương t</span><span class=\"cf0\">ối </span><span class=\"cf2\">đa l</span><span class=\"cf1\">&agrave; $84,500 v&agrave; $62,400)</span></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong><!--EndFragment --></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOGCdDfzMo4b0vxNcTDlMZwkgW6\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>5.</strong><strong> Gợi &yacute; Paraphrasing</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E8TVdaTROorfxXxMBfGldJ6pgbd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FASwd2UiCoitfbxeuYllUMqJg2b\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Bc2gdrij0o2chcxcadllSjTsgke\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XdYcdsZ6Uo6tuXxGPs3lNnJUgHh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HE29dhmJjod0qix8V1qlgw9gggc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"LhvxdlwoRowrFWxCj4llb7Acgje\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQYTdgj3eoV2QPxbQbMl5Srjg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi muốn diễn đạt \"<strong>đạt mức lương tối đa\", </strong>thay v&igrave; d&ugrave;ng<strong> \"reach the top salary\" </strong>th&igrave; m&igrave;nh c&oacute; thể paraphrase với c&aacute;c cụm sau<strong> </strong>để đa dạng cấu tr&uacute;c c&acirc;u của m&igrave;nh hơn nh&eacute;:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQYTdgj3eoV2QPxbQbMl5Srjg2d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><!--StartFragment -->\n<ul>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">receive the maximum level of + <strong>[số tiền]</strong></span></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">reach the peak earnings of + <strong>[số tiền]</strong></span></li>\n<li class=\"pf0\"><span class=\"cf0\">receive the peak salary of <strong>[số tiền]</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<!--EndFragment --></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WpSOdZlOpo7RuexNMDxlpd7xgrh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><em><strong>V&iacute; dụ: </strong>It took less than a decade for teachers in Denmark to receive the maximum level of $54,000.</em></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
